{% extends 'base.html.j2' %}
{% from 'components.html.j2' import eyebrow with context %}
{% block content %}
<section class="tool-intro wrap">{{ eyebrow('YOUR THAILAND MOVE BUDGET') }}<h1>Put a number<br>to your <em>next chapter.</em></h1><p>Start with an example, then change every assumption to fit your life.<br>These are planning inputs, not live market prices.</p></section>
<section class="wrap calculator-layout"><form id="cost-calculator" class="calculator-form"><div class="calculator-preset"><label for="budget-preset">Start with an example</label><select id="budget-preset"><option value="solo">One person</option><option value="couple">A couple</option><option value="family">A family</option></select></div><h2>Your monthly routine.</h2><p class="small">All amounts are Thai baht (THB). Replace these examples with quotes.</p><div class="cost-fields">{% for key,label in [('rent','Rent'),('food','Food & groceries'),('transport','Transport'),('health','Insurance & healthcare'),('utilities','Utilities & internet'),('personal','Personal & leisure')] %}<label for="cost-{{ key }}">{{ label }}<span class="money-input"><span>฿</span><input id="cost-{{ key }}" name="{{ key }}" type="number" min="0" max="10000000" step="100" value="{{ calculator[key] }}" required></span></label>{% endfor %}</div><h2>Make room for arrival.</h2><div class="cost-fields"><label for="cost-deposit">Rent deposit & advance payments<span class="money-input"><span>฿</span><input id="cost-deposit" name="deposit" type="number" min="0" max="10000000" value="{{ calculator.deposit }}" required></span></label><label for="cost-setup">Flights & initial setup<span class="money-input"><span>฿</span><input id="cost-setup" name="setup" type="number" min="0" max="10000000" value="{{ calculator.setup }}" required></span></label><label for="cost-buffer">Monthly planning buffer<span class="money-input"><input id="cost-buffer" name="buffer" type="number" min="0" max="100" value="{{ calculator.buffer }}" required><span>%</span></span></label></div><p class="small">Add tuition, dependants, visa and professional fees to your own plan where relevant. Official and service fees are excluded from this example.</p></form><aside class="budget-summary"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR PLANNING ESTIMATE</span><h2>Your life here,<br>on one page.</h2><span class="budget-label">MONTHLY, INCLUDING BUFFER</span><output id="monthly-total" class="budget-total">฿0</output><div class="budget-breakdown"><p><span>Monthly costs</span><output id="monthly-base">฿0</output></p><p><span>Planning buffer</span><output id="buffer-total">฿0</output></p><p><span>Deposit & setup</span><output id="arrival-total">฿0</output></p><p class="budget-arrival"><span>Arrival + first month</span><output id="first-month-total">฿0</output></p></div><a class="button button-light" id="budget-contact" href="{{ url('contact/?interest=budget') }}">Talk through my budget {{ icon('arrow') }}</a><button type="button" class="text-link" data-download-budget>Download my estimate {{ icon('download') }}</button><p class="small">Save this starting point and compare it with current quotes before committing.</p><span id="calculator-error" role="alert"></span></aside></section><noscript><div class="wrap notice">Enable JavaScript to calculate live totals. You can still use these categories to prepare a budget manually.</div></noscript>
{% endblock %}

